  "modifications": "LOCAL-CONTEXT.patch: actual sample rate and cycle bounds, fail-silent missing time, suspension Note Off, canonical automation eligibility, pre-2.34 ARM pthread ABI. Upstream Q-Link refresh fixes retained. LOCAL-NOTIFICATIONS.patch: binary search of the generated sorted parameter-index table; no change to Q-Link refresh semantics. LOCAL-STATE-VALIDATION.patch: reject embedded NULs and propagate the engine state validation result to effSetChunk. LOCAL-MOD-REFRESH.patch: MOD option notifications retain native automation/value reports without requesting a global screen reconstruction. LOCAL-BOUNDED-NOTIFICATIONS.patch: cap engine notification collection and coalesced host value delivery at 32 per audio block, with round-robin deferred delivery. LOCAL-MOD-PERFORMANCE.patch: configurable per-block notification budget, 8 for this project.",
